"","th_th":"","zh_cn":"","zh_hk":"","zh_tw":""}},"parent_task_guid":"","repeat_rule":"","source":2,"status":"todo","subtask_count":0,"summary":"除了早上和静静沟通的“礼品系列”的设计：\n1、卫浴包组合；（透明那种洗浴提袋）\n2、办公套组（用不同档次的整理袋装不同的办公组合，包括鼠标垫）；\n3、茶礼套组，一壶2-3杯+非遗茉莉花茶（不同规格）；\n4、小资咖啡套组，瑞幸咖啡（连杯）+提袋；\n5、精油疗愈套组；\n6、本地风物套组：（这个就更丰富了，天津麻花等特色小食、北塘蚶子酱螃蟹酱等，杨柳青等，津味纪念品），不同组合不同提袋；\n7、年节套组：福袋（N款都要有）+小玩具，+小香囊（香囊内容要琢磨一下特色），+精油口红或香皂，+老年人可以用的小礼品）\n8、伴手礼套组：梳理可销售的上述物品、食品，设计大包装的实际就是可以同步销售的，这个更加丰富，还可以包括醉蟹、自制肠类等厨房特产\n9、酒店品牌套组：一次性茶包咖啡包放在马口铁小盒里，体验一杯温暖，搭配杯子，提袋；一次性洗澡用品可以结合温泉泡浴用药包放在透明提袋里方便宾客洗澡泡澡用，还可以放我们的品牌小毛巾；\n----------------------------------------------------------------\n上述所有的套组，必须设计不同规格，不同材质的包装提袋@所有人 ","task_id":"t122649","tasklists":[],"updated_at":"1734067564764","url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=618cb50a-0495-4b67-a533-a032050d5a50&suite_entity_num=t122649"},{"completed_at":"0","created_at":"1733361998848","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"","extra":"","guid":"d57f20e9-2085-47fa-8d42-03891c35e3c9","is_milestone":false,"members":[{"id":"ou_7456dc7ccf01ee36feb7ccb7aca9ec97","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_9c9a96e3db30579a7992b6f6aa3e9b3a","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fa790d1435a3f6a9cddf533d6f9dffe4","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c043b57400c801eeda3e914a11cb3b28","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c043b57400c801eeda3e914a11cb3b28","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_9c9a96e3db30579a7992b6f6aa3e9b3a","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7456dc7ccf01ee36feb7ccb7aca9ec97","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fa790d1435a3f6a9cddf533d6f9dffe4","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","role":"follower","type":"user"}],"mode":2,"origin":{"href":{"title":"","url":""},"platform_i18n_name":{"de_de":"","en_us":"","es_es":"","fr_fr":"","it_it":"","ja_jp":"","ko_kr":"","ru_ru":"","th_th":"","zh_cn":"","zh_hk":"","zh_tw":""}},"parent_task_guid":"","repeat_rule":"","source":2,"status":"todo","subtask_count":0,"summary":"今年开始拟春节气氛布置清单、春节儿童玩具清单、企业会员开壳伴手礼清单、天津特色（非遗）打包清单（可以拟一份销售清单不是只能送，我们的北塘虾酱一类的是可以卖的，可以含进房费里面！）、普通会员激活物料、前台展示所有会员礼遇所需物料清单。 晚例会前提交讨论定稿，最迟明天全部下单采购完毕@朱雅静  @魏安琴  @刘东东  @邢振慧  @段艳  @赵炳涛 ","task_id":"t121985","tasklists":[],"updated_at":"1733362000184","url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=d57f20e9-2085-47fa-8d42-03891c35e3c9&suite_entity_num=t121985"},{"completed_at":"0","created_at":"1733207420552","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"","extra":"","guid":"deaec259-7cac-46e1-9dab-72ec12fef377","is_milestone":false,"members":[{"id":"ou_7456dc7ccf01ee36feb7ccb7aca9ec97","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_3517b63ffe1238e009b7fc4298ab74f9","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7456dc7ccf01ee36feb7ccb7aca9ec97","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_3517b63ffe1238e009b7fc4298ab74f9","role":"follower","type":"user"}],"mode":2,"origin":{"href":{"title":"","url":""},"platform_i18n_name":{"de_de":"","en_us":"","es_es":"","fr_fr":"","it_it":"","ja_jp":"","ko_kr":"","ru_ru":"","th_th":"","zh_cn":"","zh_hk":"","zh_tw":""}},"parent_task_guid":"","repeat_rule":"","source":2,"status":"todo","subtask_count":0,"summary":"@孙雪艳  @赵炳涛  @刘东东  @邢振慧  @所有人  当前生意难做，需要不停的学习业态的变化和人家卷在哪些上面，我们也要卷起来才行！ 现在看，并不是没有相对高消费人群，而是我们要研究如何增加“附加值”，让客人感觉花得值！ 房间里要配置更多的物品！要敞开让客人来酒店“上货”。","task_id":"t121897","tasklists":[],"updated_at":"1733207421802","url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=deaec259-7cac-46e1-9dab-72ec12fef377&suite_entity_num=t121897"},{"completed_at":"0","created_at":"1730881799106","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"","extra":"","guid":"13ceb0a9-1f6f-40aa-a6b1-3ec072fd5453","is_milestone":false,"members":[{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_97d630f90dbf4327a29cbdd301c0ac14","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_64a95e7db51f7f832a39b8643668b4de","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fa790d1435a3f6a9cddf533d6f9dffe4","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_64a95e7db51f7f832a39b8643668b4de","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_97d630f90dbf4327a29cbdd301c0ac14","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fa790d1435a3f6a9cddf533d6f9dffe4","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"follower","type":"user"}],"mode":2,"origin":{"href":{"title":"","url":""},"platform_i18n_name":{"de_de":"","en_us":"","es_es":"","fr_fr":"","it_it":"","ja_jp":"","ko_kr":"","ru_ru":"","th_th":"","zh_cn":"","zh_hk":"","zh_tw":""}},"parent_task_guid":"","repeat_rule":"","source":2,"status":"todo","subtask_count":0,"summary":"1、请立即组织对垃圾佬使用暂存垃圾点儿的清整（衣物收起），杂物全部清除，所有破损垃圾桶理修补、更新，建筑垃圾的门已经破损焊起来，地面油污全部刷洗一遍，晾晒的蔬菜区域所有的杂物再清理一遍，地面临时挖出的沟填平；@孙广宏  @郑伟  @姜国军  \n2、外围绿化所有的杂草全部拔掉、所有不整齐的进行修剪，重点是正门的花坛内类似问题全部搞好，花坛内有堆放的铁栅栏不用的就清掉，所有的洞补上（婚纱店空调外机口），婚纱店外部大风扯掉的装饰外墙钉上，导流管考虑是否有优级化方案？@姜国军  @刘东东  \n3、外围车场装饰灯看一下引明线，装铁管串线埋在土内能不能恢复照明（LED）；@姜国军  \n4、后院车场出口处的花箱整齐一下，杂草袪除，明年春节播种；@刘东东  @姜国军  @郑伟  \n5、原垃圾房和现在的木工房所有杂物扔掉，卫生搞一下；@刘东东  @姜国军  \n6、原一层粗加工间的物品再分一下类，破损的请业主财务配合记录一下，报废拍照留档；@刘东东  @朱雅静  \n7、员工通道现存挡水物资清理干净；@郑伟  （合理储存）夏季的防蝇帘刷洗、封存；（准备冬季棉帘）@姜国军  \n8、员工通道和两楼之间有石材、封面破损之处进行恢复；@姜国军  \n9、木工房要求干净整洁、配灭火器，加监控和烟感报警；@姜国军  @郑伟  \n10、后院车棚，所有外接电线符合户外电线和插座的安全要求，加线管；@郑伟  @姜国军  \n11、员工通道以及婚纱店玻璃外檐、车棚相关铁支撑考虑粉刷一下防锈；@姜国军  @郑伟  \n12、外围车场绿植附近的垃圾；@刘东东  @郑伟  \n13、外围车场多处塌陷进行填平；@姜国军  @郑伟  \n14、停车场入口、出口处的防撞桶状态差，调整一下；@姜国军  @郑伟  \n15、停车场入口、出口处地面的底部连接件清除；@姜国军 ","task_id":"t121395","tasklists":[],"updated_at":"1730881801317","url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=13ceb0a9-1f6f-40aa-a6b1-3ec072fd5453&suite_entity_num=t121395"},{"completed_at":"0","created_at":"1730788664363","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"","extra":"","guid":"053ae4de-3b16-438a-b38f-703b777dac64","is_milestone":false,"members":[{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fa790d1435a3f6a9cddf533d6f9dffe4","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c043b57400c801eeda3e914a11cb3b28","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fa790d1435a3f6a9cddf533d6f9dffe4","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c4e9c812412a4ee50408af138178ef0f","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_c043b57400c801eeda3e914a11cb3b28","role":"follower","type":"user"}],"mode":2,"origin":{"href":{"title":"","url":""},"platform_i18n_name":{"de_de":"","en_us":"","es_es":"","fr_fr":"","it_it":"","ja_jp":"","ko_kr":"","ru_ru":"","th_th":"","zh_cn":"","zh_hk":"","zh_tw":""}},"parent_task_guid":"","repeat_rule":""