's some inconsistency in how the timestamps are being recorded. The most recent update I can confidently place is from April 2026, so I should focus on identifying which tasks are actually stale based on that cutoff rather than trying to reconcile every timestamp. Looking at the task timestamps more carefully, I see the recent ones from April 13 are around 1772546400000 ms, which translates to roughly April 14, 2026 in UTC. Since it's currently April 14, 2026 at 18:11 UTC, I should focus on identifying which tasks are actually stale based on their update timestamps rather than getting caught up in the date precision.\n\nI also need to locate the shared pool progress database and update my last heartbeat time before proceeding with the summary.\n\nLooking at the tasks, most appear to be inactive with no recent updates, so I'll consolidate this into a concise report highlighting the critical items and stale tasks, then save it as a memory file and update the heartbeat."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_91eflw72txcj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"date && echo \"Current UTC ms: $(date -d '+8 hours' +%s)000\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_91eflw72txcj_2","name":"feishu_search_doc_wiki","arguments":{"action":"search","query":"共享池 工作进度","page_size":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776190280520,"responseId":"062db648da440a5c3f0a04baac118b7d"}}
